{"availability":"available","full":"mlightcad/cad-viewer","name":"cad-viewer","description":"The world’s first fully web-based DXF/DWG viewer and editor that runs entirely in the browser — no backend server required.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1101,"forks":234,"created":"2025-10-10T12:46:34Z","updated":"2026-10-04T08:11:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mlightcad.com/cad-viewer/","topics":["autocad","cad","dwg","dwg-parser","dwg-reader","dwg-to-html","dwg-viewer","dxf","dxf-parser","dxf-reader","dxf-to-html","dxf-viewer","threejs","webgl"],"demo":"https://cad-viewer-iys.pages.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.768Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.768Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.768Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.768Z","stars":1101,"forks":234}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["English | 简体中文 | 日本語 | 한국어 | Español | Português | Русский | Čeština","cad-viewer is the first web-based DXF/DWG viewer and editor in the world that operates entirely in browser, without relying on any backend services. By performing DWG/DXF parsing, geometry processing, and rendering directly in the browser, cad-viewer enables true serverless CAD viewing and editing, ideal for cloud apps, offline usage, and privacy-sensitive workflows.","It also offers something you will rarely find in other CAD viewers—one-click export to a single, self-contained HTML file. The downloaded .html embeds the drawing snapshot and a lightweight viewer runtime, so recipients can open, pan, zoom, toggle layers, and measure distances in any modern browser with no CAD app, no server, and no install. Most desktop and web CAD viewers only let you view inside their own product; cad-viewer turns a live drawing into a portable, offline artifact you can email, archive, or drop on a static file host—ideal for sharing with clients, compliance archives, and…"],"features":["🌐 Live Demo: Netlify · GitHub Pages","X (Twitter): @mlightcad","Juejin(稀土掘金): @mlightcad","High-performance viewing of large DWG/DXF files with smooth 60+ FPS rendering","No backend required - Files are parsed and processed entirely in the browser"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mlightcad/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c9ec6b66e4f64afdf9b6cab2451fed826f9c0250946d5e35d1454a2427688dce","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:11:54.964Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.902Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"English | 简体中文 | 日本語 | 한국어 | Español | Português | Русский | Čeština","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mlightcad/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"cad-viewer is the first web-based DXF/DWG viewer and editor in the world that operates entirely in browser, without relying on any backend services. By performing DWG/DXF parsing, geometry processing, and rendering directly in the browser, cad-viewer enables true serverless CAD viewing and editing, ideal for cloud apps, offline usage, and privacy-sensitive workflows.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mlightcad/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md"},{"text":"It also offers something you will rarely find in other CAD viewers—one-click export to a single, self-contained HTML file. The downloaded .html embeds the drawing snapshot and a lightweight viewer runtime, so recipients can open, pan, zoom, toggle layers, and measure distances in any modern browser with no CAD app, no server, and no install. Most desktop and web CAD viewers…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mlightcad/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c9ec6b66e4f64afdf9b6cab2451fed826f9c0250946d5e35d1454a2427688dce","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mlightcad/cad-viewer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:15:53.903Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T08:11:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mlightcad/cad-vie